 "remarks": "Welcome to 21 Soundview Avenue, a beautifully renovated multifamily investment opportunity in the heart of vibrant South Norwalk. Blending timeless character with modern finishes, this property offers an attractive combination of immediate rental income and additional earning potential. The second floor is currently rented for $2,650 per month, while the vacant first floor has an estimated rental value of $3,350 per month. Detached garages offer additional potential rental income of $300 to $500 per month, bringing the property's estimated gross income potential to $75,600 to $78,000 annually when fully rented. Renovated inside and out, the property features bright, inviting interiors with wide plank flooring, recessed lighting, updated kitchens with white cabinetry, granite countertops, subway tile backsplashes, and stainless steel appliances. Updated bathrooms, central air, and in unit laundry add everyday convenience and appeal. A charming front porch, off street parking, and garage storage further enhance the property. Just minutes from South Norwalk's restaurants, shopping, parks, beaches, train station, I-95, and Route 1, this property is ideally positioned to attract tenants. An appealing turnkey opportunity for investors seeking a refreshed property with strong income potential in a desirable location.",
